{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#576","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#576","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#576\",\"parent_revision\":\"0a7ce375383a0e8c99266330def4eb2a0dab140b6b3d573877fdb715523bea3f\",\"root_revision\":\"0a7ce375383a0e8c99266330def4eb2a0dab140b6b3d573877fdb715523bea3f\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P1\\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-12\\n-->\\n\\n## RT-ICA\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nRT-ICA Snapshot: SubagentStop hook should capture structured summary of subagent work\\nDate: 2026-04-23\\nGoal: Add structured summary capture to the SubagentStop handler in task_status_hook.py so orchestrators have a durable artifact describing completed work.\\n\\nConditions:\\n1. task_status_hook.py SubagentStop handler | AVAILABLE | plugins/development-harness/skills/implementation-manager/scripts/task_status_hook.py\\n2. Task model fields available for summary | AVAILABLE | sam_schema/core/models.py \u2014 Task model has context_notes, last_activity, completed_at; no existing summary: field\\n3. implement-feature routing decision protocol | AVAILABLE | plugins/development-harness/skills/implement-feature/SKILL.md Progress Loop section\\n4. Summary schema design | DERIVABLE | fields: files_modified, tests_added, key_decisions, errors_encountered, duration_seconds \u2014 design needs confirmation\\n5. Storage location decision | DERIVABLE | two candidates: task YAML frontmatter summary: block vs .claude/context/summaries/{session_id}-{task_id}.json \u2014 tradeoffs: YAML is co-located, JSON is queryable\\n\\nAVAILABLE count: 3\\nDERIVABLE count: 2\\nMISSING count: 0\\n\\nDecision: APPROVED \u2014 implementation path clear; storage location is the only design decision needed before coding.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Groomed (2026-04-23)\\n\\n### Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- [ ] `task_status_hook.py` SubagentStop handler writes a `summary:` field to the task YAML frontmatter containing: `files_modified` (list of paths), `tests_added` (int), `key_decisions` (list of strings, max 5), `errors_encountered` (list of strings), `duration_seconds` (int computed from Started to Completed)\\n- [ ] `uv run implementation_manager.py status . {slug}` output includes `summary:` block for each COMPLETE task that has one\\n- [ ] `uv run pytest plugins/development-harness/tests/ -k task_status_hook -x` passes including new test for summary field presence after SubagentStop simulation\\n- [ ] `uv run ty check plugins/development-harness/skills/implementation-manager/scripts/task_status_hook.py` \u2014 zero errors\\n- [ ] `uv run ruff check plugins/development-harness/skills/implementation-manager/scripts/task_status_hook.py` \u2014 zero errors\\n- [ ] If summary data cannot be extracted from SubagentStop context, the field is set to `{\\\"note\\\": \\\"unavailable \u2014 no structured output in stop event\\\"}` rather than omitted or silently failing\\n\\n### Files\\n\\n- `plugins/development-harness/skills/implementation-manager/scripts/task_status_hook.py` \u2014 SubagentStop handler (primary change)\\n- `plugins/development-harness/sam_schema/core/models.py` \u2014 Task model (add summary: field if stored in YAML)\\n- `plugins/development-harness/skills/implement-feature/SKILL.md` \u2014 update Progress Loop routing to reference summary artifact\\n- `plugins/development-harness/tests/` \u2014 new or extended test for SubagentStop summary capture\\n\\n### Story\\n\\nAs an **implement-feature orchestrator**, I want **each completed subagent task to produce a structured work summary** so that **routing decisions for dependent tasks are based on what the agent actually did \u2014 not inferred from context window output that disappears on compaction**.\\n\\n## Measurable Signal\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAfter SubagentStop fires for a task, the task file's YAML frontmatter contains a `summary:` block with at least `files_modified` and `duration_seconds` fields populated. Verify by reading the task file after a task completes: `uv run implementation_manager.py status . {slug}` output includes a `summary` key for completed tasks.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer using Claude Code skills**, I want to **subagentstop hook should capture structured summary of subagent work** so that **the tooling becomes more capable and complete**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Research entry: ./research/agent-frameworks/everything-claude-code.md \u2014 pattern: Session Summaries in Hook SubagentStop Phase\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-10\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\\n## Current State\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n`task_status_hook.py` handles `SubagentStop` by marking the task COMPLETE, adding a `completed` timestamp, deleting the context file, and syncing completion to GitHub. It does NOT capture any summary of what the subagent accomplished \u2014 no record of files changed, tests written, errors encountered, or decisions made. The parent orchestrator (`implement-feature`) receives only the raw sub-agent output in its context window (which is lost on compaction) and has no structured artifact to reference when making routing decisions for subsequent tasks.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Target State\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n`task_status_hook.py` SubagentStop handler writes a `summary` field to the task YAML frontmatter (or a separate `.claude/context/summaries/{session_id}-{task_id}.json` file) containing: files_modified (list), tests_added (count), key_decisions (list of strings), errors_encountered (list), and duration_seconds (int, computed from Started to Completed). The `implement-feature` orchestrator can read these summaries when deciding routing for dependent tasks.\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"74dc9c1c62ae50f2d2d70d8bb136381f40d1c52c0b0d41b89b89c23c41c74621\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPTD7Kg\"}"}